{"context":{"actorId":"8","conditions":"","conversantId":"1","conversation":"gossip/bird/fistingCloaca","conversationId":272,"entryId":162,"field":"Dialogue Text","next":[[272,163]],"script":""},"group":"excuse-oneself-take-leave","id":"ds:272:162:Dialogue Text","newTarget":"[pic=2]После се оттеглихме и прекарахме прекрасен следобед на езерото. Пийнахме вино и говорихме за какво ли не, докато денят се изниза.","newTargetSha256":"159825daf5104494d23b3dfe073d55b9379f5e85e0700b3d281eb6bbaa714c52","oldTarget":"[pic=2]После се извинихме и прекарахме прекрасен следобед на езерото. Пийнахме вино и говорихме за какво ли не, докато денят се изниза.","oldTargetSha256":"e9f7dfa5e1c83da4a32b1f7ab26469a84ada4ecbc1e20f9f165eb436772794ae","selectors":[{"asset":"StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle","kind":"field","pathId":-9011735310751668748,"pointer":"/conversations/132/dialogueEntries/31/fields/6/value"},{"asset":"sharedassets0.assets","kind":"field","pathId":3336,"pointer":"/conversations/132/dialogueEntries/31/fields/6/value"}],"source":"[pic=2]Then we excused ourselves and had a lovely afternoon on the lake. We had some wine and talked the day away about all sorts of stuff.","sourceSha256":"5c5c3335afc72bdb129660b3817b85345c5e8316350226c10fa308d0423e33ae"}
